---
import PageContainer from "@components/PageContainer.astro";
import SoftwareIconShield from "@components/SoftwareIconShield.astro";
import BasePageLayout from "@layouts/BasePageLayout.astro";
---

<BasePageLayout title="About">
    <PageContainer>
        <!-- <h1 id="about-title" style="text-align: left;">Resume / Experience</h1> -->
        <div class="box">
            <h2>Experience</h2>

            <p>
                I'm experienced in software development of all kinds (systems
                programming, embedded firmware, web dev, CI/CD, game modding,
                linux sysadmin, some graphics, scripting, etc). My main
                interests are in low-level and embedded programming: C/Zig/Rust,
                microcontrollers, event loops and task switching, embedded
                device drivers, communication protocols,... all the really fun
                stuff!
            </p>
            <p>
                I also have experience in electronics of many forms, mostly
                thanks to Formula Student. Among my main interests are motor
                controllers, PCB design, power conversion, high speed digital
                and analog circuit design. I'd love for a chance to develop PCBs
                professionally.
            </p>

            <p>
                I'm always looking for exciting work opportunities. If you know
                of an opening in Embedded Systems / Firmware Development /
                Electrical Engineering or a related field, please feel free to
                reach me <a
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    href="mailto:nystromjp@gmail.com">by email</a
                >!
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
            <details open>
                <summary style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <h2 style="display: inline;">Resume</h2>
                </summary>
                <div id="resume-container">
                    <object
                        id="resume"
                        data="/Resume_Jack_Nystrom.pdf#navpanes=0&statusbar=0&messages=0&scrollbar=0&view=fit&zoom=auto"
                        type="application/pdf"
                        width="100%"
                        height="100%"
                    >
                        <p>
                            It appears your browser doesn't have PDF support.
                            You can <a href="/Resume_Jack_Nystrom.pdf"
                                >click here to download the resume PDF.</a
                            >
                        </p>
                    </object>
                    <br />
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
            <h2>Programming</h2>
            <div>
                <p>Some of the languages I've used a lot:</p>
                <div class="icon-card-wrapper">
                    <!-- Icons from simpleicons.org, also devicon.dev as a backup -->
                    <!-- Determine colors using ../../get_language_color.sh (which uses github-linguists) -->
                    <!-- TODO: replace all these with NF icons via icon update branch? -->
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="C++"
                        color="#f34b7d"
                        slug="cplusplus"
                    />
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="Rust"
                        color="#dea584"
                        slug="rust"
                    />
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="Python"
                        color="#3572A5"
                        slug="python"
                    />
                    <SoftwareIconShield name="Lua" color="#000080" slug="lua" />
                    <SoftwareIconShield name="C" color="#555555" slug="c" />
                    <SoftwareIconShield name="Java" color="#b07219" slug="" />
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="Bash"
                        color="#89e051"
                        slug="gnubash"
                    />
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="TypeScript"
                        color="#3178c6"
                        slug="typescript"
                    />
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="Astro"
                        color="#ff5a03"
                        slug="astro"
                    />
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="React"
                        color="#61dafb"
                        slug="react"
                    />
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="Nix"
                        color="#7e7eff"
                        slug="nixos"
                    />
                </div>
                <p>What I actually enjoy writing:</p>
                <div class="icon-card-wrapper">
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="Rust"
                        color="#dea584"
                        slug="rust"
                    />
                    <SoftwareIconShield name="Zig" color="#ec915c" slug="zig" />
                    <SoftwareIconShield name="C" color="#555555" slug="c" />
                    <SoftwareIconShield
                        name="C++"
                        color="#f34b7d"
                        slug="cplusplus"
                    />
                    <!-- <SoftwareIconShield name="Nix" color="#7e7eff" slug="nixos" /> -->
                </div>
            </div>
            <p>
                For electronics I'm a fan of KiCad and enjoy working with
                STM32s. I've used FreeRTOS and Arm MbedOS, as well as AVR's
                baremetal SDK on an ATtiny.
            </p>
        </div>
    </PageContainer>
</BasePageLayout>
<style>
    .box {
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background-color: var(--bg2);
        box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 0px 5px 10px;
        margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .box > p {
    }
    .box > h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
    }
    .box li {
        /* add a little vertical space between bullets */
        margin: 0.5em 0;
    }
    #about-title {
        margin: 0 10px;
        /* text-shadow: 2px 4px 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); */
    }
    #resume-container {
    }
    #resume {
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        /* max-width: 40em; */
        max-width: 8.5in;
        max-height: 11in;

        aspect-ratio: 8.5 / 11;
        /* height: 11in; */
        display: block;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0px 5px 10px;
        filter: brightness(85%);
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .icon-card-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: -8px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
</style>
